#: ai-translator-for-translatepress.php
msgid "Translation engine for TranslatePress using Google Gemini or any OpenAI-compatible API. Translations are mapped by ID and validated before TranslatePress saves them; failed strings stay untranslated and are retried later instead of being saved wrong."
msgstr ""

